<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="./cover-character.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="./timeline-source.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="./roles-source.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="./material-curve-1.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="./material-curve-2.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="./material-curve-3.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="./data-loop-source.png"/><title>《三国：冰河时代》发行拆解复盘</title><meta name="description" content="从资料整理到建立判断——产品发行全链路拆解心得分享"/><link rel="shortcut icon" href="./favicon.svg"/><link rel="icon" href="./favicon.svg"/><meta name="codex-preview" content="development"/>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="./assets/styles.css"></head><body><main><div class="reading-progress"><span style="width:0%"></span></div><header class="topbar"><button class="wordmark"><b>PROCESS REVIEW</b><span>心得分享 · MZR</span></button><nav><button>拆解路径</button><button>产品认知</button><button>发行阶段</button><button>岗位与预算</button><button>素材拆解</button><button>整体复盘</button></nav><span class="page-count">11 PAGES</span></header><section class="hero" id="top"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="kicker">作业复盘 · 心得分享</span><h1>从资料整理<br/><strong>到建立判断</strong></h1><p>《三国：冰河时代》产品发行全链路拆解</p><div class="hero-tags"><span>数据边界</span><span>证据链</span><span>项目针对性</span><span>修改复盘</span></div><button class="primary">开始阅读 <span>↓</span></button></div><div class="hero-art"><img src="./cover-character.png" alt="PPT封面中的三国角色"/><span>01 / 11</span></div></section><section class="section" id="path"><div class="section-title"><span>01</span><div><p>PROCESS REVIEW</p><h2>整体拆解路径</h2><small>从产品理解出发，逐步还原发行链路</small></div></div><div class="process-line"><div><span>01</span><b>产品基础认知</b></div><div><span>02</span><b>发行时间轴</b></div><div><span>03</span><b>阶段目标与指标</b></div><div><span>04</span><b>岗位协同</b></div><div><span>05</span><b>预算逻辑</b></div><div><span>06</span><b>素材拆解</b></div></div><div class="three-notes"><article class="note-card blue"><span>拆解任务</span><p>先明确任务目标，再为每一章明确核心问题，避免资料堆叠。</p></article><article class="note-card orange"><span>主要资料来源</span><p>实际体验、公开平台信息、投放趋势、版本记录、课程内容、导师指导。</p></article><article class="note-card green"><span>输出目标</span><p>从公开事实出发形成有限判断，并标记无法确认的信息。</p></article></div><blockquote>没有一开始就追求写得多，而是先确定：每一章到底要回答什么问题。</blockquote></section><section class="section soft" id="product"><div class="section-title"><span>02</span><div><p>PROCESS REVIEW</p><h2>产品基础认知</h2><small>通过实际体验建立后续发行分析基础</small></div></div><div class="product-grid"><article style="--accent:#4b82e8"><span>竞品范围与差异化包装</span><h3>品类定位</h3><p>三国 IP / 冰雪生存 / 竖屏休闲化 SLG</p></article><article style="--accent:#26a6ae"><span>长期循环与核心体验</span><h3>核心玩法</h3><p>资源生产 → 战力养成 → 战斗验证 → 地图扩张 → 联盟竞争</p></article><article style="--accent:#f0a63c"><span>产品设计推断 + 公开数据验证</span><h3>用户画像</h3><p>题材、操作复杂度、社交设计、付费门槛共同推断</p></article><article style="--accent:#55b887"><span>入口、档位与付费深度</span><h3>商业化</h3><p>首充 / 月卡 / 战令 / VIP / 限时礼包 / 抽卡招募</p></article></div><div class="making-logic"><b>制作逻辑</b><p>实际游玩形成产品感知，寻找公开数据补充用户画像，商城截图支撑商业化判断。</p></div></section><section class="section" id="timeline"><div class="section-title"><span>03</span><div><p>PROCESS REVIEW</p><h2>发行时间轴还原</h2><small>通过关键节点与公开信号判断阶段变化</small></div></div><div class="stage-tabs" role="tablist"><button class="active"><span>01</span>测试期</button><button class=""><span>02</span>预热期</button><button class=""><span>03</span>上线期</button><button class=""><span>04</span>长线期</button></div><div class="stage-detail"><div><span>阶段目标</span><h3>产品价值验证</h3><p>以产品价值和用户需求为核心，建立验证方向。</p></div><div><span>公开信号</span><h3>版号 / 测试</h3><p>阶段划分来自多个公开信号的共同变化，并保留判断依据。</p></div><img src="./timeline-source.png" alt="PPT中的发行时间轴总图"/></div><div class="boundary-block"><h3>公开信息支持到哪里，结论就停在哪里</h3><div class="evidence-table"><div class="head"><b>公开信号</b><b>可支持判断</b><b>仍无法确认</b></div><div><span>时间节点</span><span>产品阶段变化</span><span>内部决策原因</span></div><div><span>投放趋势</span><span>放量节奏变化</span><span>具体预算与 ROI</span></div><div><span>版本记录</span><span>内容持续供给</span><span>留存与付费效果</span></div></div><div class="boundary-legend"><span><b>事实</b>公开资料直接确认</span><span><b>推断</b>多个信号共同支持</span><span><b>未确认</b>缺少可靠数据支撑</span></div></div></section><section class="section soft" id="collab"><div class="section-title"><span>04</span><div><p>PROCESS REVIEW</p><h2>阶段目标、岗位协同与预算逻辑</h2><small>围绕四个发行阶段拆解工作重点与增长循环</small></div></div><div class="phase-goals"><div><span>测试期</span><b>产品价值验证</b><small>验证方向</small></div><div><span>预热期</span><b>获客模型验证</b><small>资源准备</small></div><div><span>上线期</span><b>规模增长验证</b><small>集中放量</small></div><div><span>长线期</span><b>持续运营验证</b><small>持续运营</small></div></div><div class="collab-grid"><div class="jobs"><span class="overline">岗位协同</span><h3>六类岗位，围绕同一阶段中心协作</h3><div><span>投放</span><span>渠道</span><span>营销</span><span>创意</span><span>美术</span><span>社区</span></div><p>当前局限：岗位职责具有较强通用性，缺少具体发行事件中的协作还原。</p></div><div class="source-image"><img src="./roles-source.png" alt="PPT中的岗位协同方式变化"/></div></div><div class="loops"><article><span>素材迭代循环</span><h3>创意方向 → 素材制作 → 买量测试 → 数据反馈 → 创意调整</h3><p>核心作用：提升获客效率，筛选可放大的创意方向。</p></article><article><span>自然量增长循环</span><h3>跑量内容 → 营销传播 → 渠道承接 → 社区沉淀 → UGC与口碑 → 反哺素材</h3><p>核心作用：扩大内容影响，沉淀长期传播资产。</p></article></div><p class="boundary-note">边界说明：循环框架来自课程方法与前文发行逻辑的归纳，真实预算结构和投入产出仍需要内部数据验证。</p></section><section class="section" id="material"><div class="section-title"><span>05</span><div><p>PROCESS REVIEW</p><h2>素材拆解</h2><small>通过统一框架提高三条素材的可比较性</small></div></div><div class="material-tabs"><button class="active">三段式结构</button><button class="">视觉层</button><button class="">听觉层</button><button class="">玩法层</button><button class="">心流曲线</button></div><div class="material-focus"><span>当前分析维度</span><h3>三段式结构</h3><p>钩子 / 卖点 / CTA</p></div><div class="curve-gallery"><button><img src="./material-curve-1.png" alt="PPT中的素材1用户观看心流曲线"/><span>素材 1 · 用户观看心流曲线</span></button><button><img src="./material-curve-2.png" alt="PPT中的素材2用户观看心流曲线"/><span>素材 2 · 用户观看心流曲线</span></button><button><img src="./material-curve-3.png" alt="PPT中的素材3用户观看心流曲线"/><span>素材 3 · 用户观看心流曲线</span></button></div><blockquote>输出形式：统一分析框架 + 个人判断 + 结合数据分析。从画面记录转向效果判断。</blockquote></section><section class="section soft" id="review"><div class="section-title"><span>06</span><div><p>PROCESS REVIEW</p><h2>整体复盘</h2><small>有效方法与待完善部分</small></div></div><div class="review-columns"><div><span class="overline">习得经验</span><article><span>01</span><div><h3>数据思维</h3><p>控制结论范围</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>证据链判断</h3><p>多个公开信号交叉验证</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>时间轴还原</h3><p>保留阶段判断依据</p></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h3>统一素材框架</h3><p>形成可比较的拆解方法</p></div></article></div><div><span class="overline red">待完善部分</span><article><span>01</span><div><h3>阶段指标</h3><p>产品数据结合不足</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>岗位协同</h3><p>具体项目事件不足</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>预算逻辑</h3><p>内部数据验证不足</p></div></article></div></div><div class="next-direction"><b>后续提升方向</b><p>增加具体产品证据，减少通用知识解释，提高分析的项目针对性。</p></div><div class="final-path"><div><span><b>1</b>拆问题</span><span><b>2</b>找资料</span><span><b>3</b>判断资料</span><span><b>4</b>建立结构</span><span><b>5</b>画出关系</span><span><b>6</b>检查边界</span><span><b>7</b>根据反馈修改</span></div><img src="./data-loop-source.png" alt="PPT中的数据闭环图"/></div><div class="final-quote"><span>收束观点</span><h2>先把判断过程做清楚，内容会逐步形成结构。</h2><p>信息越不完整，越需要保留边界。AI 会产生幻觉，需要自主斟酌、核验正确与否。</p></div></section><footer><b>PROCESS REVIEW</b><span>《三国：冰河时代》产品发行全链路拆解 · 心得分享</span><button>返回顶部 ↑</button></footer></main>
<script>
(() => {
  const ids = ["path","product","timeline","collab","material","review"];
  const jump = id => document.getElementById(id)?.scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth"});
  document.querySelectorAll("nav button").forEach((button,index) => button.addEventListener("click", () => jump(ids[index])));
  document.querySelector(".wordmark")?.addEventListener("click", () => jump("top"));
  document.querySelector(".primary")?.addEventListener("click", () => jump("path"));
  document.querySelector("footer button")?.addEventListener("click", () => jump("top"));
  const bar = document.querySelector(".reading-progress span");
  const updateProgress = () => { const max = document.documentElement.scrollHeight - innerHeight; bar.style.width = (max > 0 ? Math.min(100, scrollY / max * 100) : 0) + "%"; };
  addEventListener("scroll", updateProgress, {passive:true}); updateProgress();

  const stages = [
    ["产品价值验证","以产品价值和用户需求为核心，建立验证方向。","版号 / 测试"],
    ["获客模型验证","观察市场反馈，验证可持续的获客方式。","首次投放 / 投放爬坡"],
    ["规模增长验证","集中放量，判断规模增长是否成立。","微信小游戏 / App 端上线"],
    ["持续运营验证","以内容供给和运营信号判断长线状态。","版本更新 / 榜单 / 持续投放"]
  ];
  const stageButtons = [...document.querySelectorAll(".stage-tabs button")];
  stageButtons.forEach((button,index) => button.addEventListener("click", () => {
    stageButtons.forEach(x => x.classList.remove("active")); button.classList.add("active");
    const cards = document.querySelectorAll(".stage-detail > div");
    cards[0].querySelector("h3").textContent = stages[index][0]; cards[0].querySelector("p").textContent = stages[index][1];
    cards[1].querySelector("h3").textContent = stages[index][2];
  }));

  const materials = [
    ["三段式结构","钩子 / 卖点 / CTA"],["视觉层","色彩、主体、运动、镜头"],
    ["听觉层","BGM、音效、口播、卡点"],["玩法层","展示系统与用户匹配"],
    ["心流曲线","节奏、反馈、高潮、断裂"]
  ];
  const materialButtons = [...document.querySelectorAll(".material-tabs button")];
  const focusTitle = document.querySelector(".material-focus h3");
  const focusCopy = document.querySelector(".material-focus p");
  const setMaterial = index => { materialButtons.forEach(x => x.classList.remove("active")); materialButtons[index].classList.add("active"); focusTitle.textContent = materials[index][0]; focusCopy.textContent = materials[index][1]; };
  materialButtons.forEach((button,index) => button.addEventListener("click", () => setMaterial(index)));
  document.querySelectorAll(".curve-gallery button").forEach(button => button.addEventListener("click", () => setMaterial(4)));
})();
</script></body></html>